<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Skoda Jan output rises 10 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Skoda Jan output rises 10 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Skoda Auto a.s., a unit of Volkswagen AG, on Wednesday said its output in January rose 10 percent, year-on-year, to total 24,415 vehicles.</p>
</text>
